{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1354809-bonfire-iconic-anima-banner-how-big-is-it","id":1354809,"title":"Bonfire/Iconic Anima Banner - how big is it?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-12-13T13:32:31-08:00","id":1354809,"title":"Bonfire/Iconic Anima Banner - how big is it?","content":"The 3rd ED book describes it as such:<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> This phantasmal display then collapses into a raging bonfire of spiritual power stretching high into the air, visible for miles. </div> </div> </div>When you are thinking about it, do you imagine the anima banner at max level to be like a DBZ super saiyan (2-9 feet tall), the Aggie bonfire (50-100 feet tall) or skyscraper on fire (100s of feet tall)?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24362-fredo","name":"Fredo","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"24"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-13T13:45:38-08:00","id":1354813,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Fredo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1354809-bonfire-iconic-anima-banner-how-big-is-it#post1354809\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">When you are thinking about it, do you imagine the anima banner at max level to be like a DBZ super saiyan (2-9 feet tall), the Aggie bonfire (50-100 feet tall) or skyscraper on fire (100s of feet tall)?</div> </div> </div> </div>Personally, I tend to picture it more as the first, but with a distinct &quot;beam of light stretching upwards&quot; effect as well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Interested in chatting with other Exalted fans online? Join us on the <a href=\"https://discord.gg/kGsyF5jhdy\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted Discord server</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1533-kelly-pedersen","name":"Kelly Pedersen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1533_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"929"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-13T14:25:48-08:00","id":1354822,"title":"","content":"I tend to describe it as huge enough to be eye catching for the setting of the scene. In an indoor fight the top of the iconic display scrapes the ceiling, but a grand speech under the open sky has the iconic display tower into the heavens. I think it more comes down to the narrative weight that going Bonfire represents; no matter the Exalt type it means you aren't holding back and that needs an appropriately HUGE icon to show how cool that is.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13696-knurlurzhad","name":"Knurlurzhad","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13696_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"74"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-13T14:53:59-08:00","id":1354824,"title":"","content":"It depends on the exact exalt and the action being 